bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Public Profile Page" as UI
boundary Router
control UserController
control UserService
entity ":UserModel" as UserModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click other user's profile
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /api/user/public/{id}
activate Router

Router -> UserController: 3. getPublicUser(id)
activate UserController
UserController -> UserService: 4. getPublicUserById(id)
activate UserService

UserService -> UserService: 5. Check id
activate UserService
space
deactivate UserService

opt Invalid id
  UserService --> UserController: 5.1. NotFoundException
  UserController --> Router: 5.2. HTTP response
  Router --> UI: 5.3. HTTP response
  UI --> User: 5.4. Show error
end

UserService -> UserModel: 6. findById().select(username,avatar,bio,role)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 7. get user by id
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 8. return user
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 9. return user
deactivate UserModel

UserService -> UserService: 10. Check user
activate UserService
space
deactivate UserService

opt User is null
  UserService --> UserController: 10.1. NotFoundException
  UserController --> Router: 10.2. HTTP response
  Router --> UI: 10.3. HTTP response
  UI --> User: 10.4. Show error
end

UserService --> UserController: 11. Return public profile
deactivate UserService
UserController --> Router: 12. HTTP response
deactivate UserController

Router --> UI: 13. Render profile / show error
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 14. Show profile
deactivate UI
deactivate User